{{ $enableLocalLLM := eq (trim (output "sh" "-c" "if grep -qi microsoft /proc/version 2>/dev/null || { [ -r /etc/os-release ] && . /etc/os-release && [ \"$ID\" = ubuntu ]; }; then printf true; else printf false; fi")) "true" -}}
{
  "packages": [
    "npm:pi-poke@1.2.8",
    "npm:pi-agent-router@0.9.0",
    "npm:@gotgenes/pi-subagents@21.9.1",
    "npm:@gotgenes/pi-permission-system@36.2.1",
    "npm:pi-lsp-extension",
    "npm:pi-web-access@0.35.0",
    "npm:@henryqw/pi-ask-question@2.0.4",
    "git:github.com/mizchi/explainer"
  ],
  "npmCommand": ["npm"],
  "lastChangelogVersion": "1.0.0",
{{ if $enableLocalLLM }}
  "defaultProvider": "openai",
  "defaultModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
{{ end }}
  "theme": "system",
  "hideThinkingBlock": false,
  "defaultProjectTrust": "ask",
  "defaultTools": ["+grep", "+find", "+ls", "+codemode"],
  "compaction": {
    "enabled": true,
    "reserveTokens": 32768,
    "keepRecentTokens": 15000
  },
  "extensions": ["-extensions/principle-guard.ts"],
  "skills": []{{ if stat (joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir ".pi/agent/settings.json") }}{{ $settings := include (joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir ".pi/agent/settings.json") | fromJson }}{{ if $settings.deviceId }},
  "deviceId": {{ $settings.deviceId | toJson }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
}
